---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import ContentPage from '../../components/ContentPage.astro';
import { SITE } from '../../data/site';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Learn what SummaryIn collects, how the browser-based generator handles your text, and how to contact us about privacy."
  yearInTitle={false}
>
  <ContentPage
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Privacy Policy"
    lead="This policy explains what information SummaryIn processes when you browse the site, use the generator, email us, or use an email signup form."
    updated="July 31, 2026"
  >
    <div class="notice">
      <p><strong>The short version:</strong> the resume summary generator runs in your browser. SummaryIn does not receive or store the role, skills, or resume text you enter into it.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Information you enter into the generator</h2>
    <p>
      The generator combines local templates with the choices you make on the page. This processing
      happens on your device. The text is not submitted to SummaryIn, stored in a SummaryIn account, or
      sent to an external AI provider. If you use your browser's copy function, the copied text is
      handled by your device and browser.
    </p>

    <h2>Analytics and technical information</h2>
    <p>
      SummaryIn uses Vercel Web Analytics to understand which pages are useful and how the site is
      accessed. Vercel describes this service as cookie-free and says it stores anonymized, aggregated
      analytics rather than identifiers that track a person across sites.
    </p>
    <p>The analytics service may process information such as:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>the page or route viewed and the time of the visit;</li>
      <li>the referring site;</li>
      <li>browser, operating system, and device type;</li>
      <li>approximate geographic information derived from the request.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Hosting and security providers may also process standard request information, including IP
      addresses and server logs, to deliver the site, prevent abuse, diagnose errors, and maintain
      security. You can read Vercel's
      <a href="https://vercel.com/docs/analytics/privacy-policy" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Web Analytics privacy documentation</a>
      and <a href="https://vercel.com/legal/privacy-notice" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Privacy Notice</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Email and contact information</h2>
    <p>
      If you email us, we receive your email address and anything you include in the message. We use it
      to respond, investigate corrections, handle privacy requests, or evaluate a proposal. We keep
      correspondence only as long as it remains useful for those purposes or is required for legal or
      security reasons.
    </p>
    <p>
      Some pages may display an email download form. When a form is connected to a mailing provider,
      the address you submit will be processed to deliver the requested resource and any follow-up you
      were clearly told about. We will identify the provider or update this policy before enabling a new
      collection method.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      SummaryIn does not currently set advertising cookies, and Vercel Web Analytics does not use
      cookies. A third-party site you open from SummaryIn may use its own cookies under its own policy.
    </p>

    <h2>Sharing and selling information</h2>
    <p>
      We do not sell personal information. Information may be processed by service providers that host,
      secure, analyze, or operate the site. We may also disclose information when required by law or
      when reasonably necessary to protect the site, its users, or others from harm.
    </p>

    <h2>Data rights</h2>
    <p>
      Depending on where you live, you may have rights to request access, correction, deletion,
      restriction, or a copy of personal information. You may also have the right to object to certain
      processing. Send requests to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>.
      We may need to verify the request before acting on it.
    </p>

    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>
      SummaryIn is a general career resource and is not directed to children under 13. If you believe a
      child has sent personal information by email or through an enabled form, contact us so we can
      review and remove it when appropriate.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy when the site, its providers, or legal requirements change. The date at
      the top of the page shows the latest revision.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Privacy questions can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${SITE.contactEmail}`}>{SITE.contactEmail}</a>.</p>
  </ContentPage>
</Base>
